{"articleNo":"2750","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2750&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-1학기 대학원별 휴복학신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.02.07","hit":"10629","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"563\" height=\"1344\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n            </p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"564\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"67\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;\">2011-1학기 대학원(일반, 산업 ,교육 및 컨설팅)<br>휴복학 신청 안내</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><br></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ 등록금 인상분/분납금 미납자는 휴복학 신청이 불가합니다.&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 휴&nbsp; 학(인터넷 접수) (문의: 대학원지원팀 ☎ 054-478-7015~16)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 2. 15(화) ~ 2. 18(금) [4일간]</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수절차 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 우리대학 홈페이지 <strong>원스톱서비스 로그인</strong> </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;↓</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 학적 → 휴학신청접수 → 군입대 및 질병휴학자 관련서류제출(24시간이내)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;≪특히 예비군대상자는 정확한 개인정보를 입력하여야 함≫ </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ③ 휴학 확정 여부 확인 : 접수 및 구비서류 제출 후 다음날 오후 1시 이후(휴일제외)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;≪조회 : 원스톱서비스 → 학적→ 학적 및 각종자료조회 → 학적변동≫</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 일반휴학은 수업일수 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1/4선(2011. 3. 28)까지 만 허용됨<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 인터넷으로 휴학 신청시 제출서류 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\">\n            </p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"72\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"22\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">구 분</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"69\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"22\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">일반휴학</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"206\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"22\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">군입대휴학</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"193\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"22\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">질병휴학</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"72\" bgcolor=\"#ccffcc\" height=\"84\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">제출해야할구비<br>서류</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"69\" height=\"84\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">제출서류 없음</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"206\" height=\"84\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">입영통지서 또는<br>군복무확인서 사본 1부.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">※ 증빙서 하단에 학번 및&nbsp;<br>연락처&nbsp; 반드시 기재</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"193\" height=\"84\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">4주이상 진단서 1부.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">※ 증빙서 하단에 학번 및<br>&nbsp;연락처 반드시 기재</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"72\" bgcolor=\"#ccffcc\" height=\"43\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">제출기일및 장소</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"69\" height=\"43\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">제출서류 없음</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"399\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"43\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">휴학신청 후 24시간 이내 제출해야 됨<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">대학원지원팀(본관 302호)</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"72\" bgcolor=\"#ccffcc\" height=\"142\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">유의</span></p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">사항</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"69\" height=\"142\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"399\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"142\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">구비서류 미제출자는 3일 후 휴학신청이 자동 취소됩니다.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">구비서류 FAX전송자는 도착여부 반드시 확인 바랍니다.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">FAX.(054)478-7020&nbsp;&nbsp; TEL.(054)478-7015~16<br>※ 군입대 휴학 후 귀향조치 또는 입영거부 학생은 즉시 대학원지원팀에 신고하여야 합니다.&nbsp; </span></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2.복&nbsp; 학(인터넷 접수) (문의: 대학원지원팀 ☎ 054-478-7015~16)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 2. 15(화) ~ 2. 18(금) [4일간]</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 복학신청은 등록금 완납 후 다음날 오후 1시부터 신청 가능 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 등록금을 납부하고 휴학한 학생은 인터넷으로 복학신청이 가능함. </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▶ 군제대복학예정자의 전역일자가 1/4선(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 3. 28</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">) 이후일 경우에는&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;대학원지원팀&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☎(054)478-7015~16으로 문의 바람 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수절차 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 우리대학 홈페이지 <strong>원스톱서비스 로그인</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;↓</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ② 학적 → 복학신청접수 ≪특히 예비군대상자는 정확한 개인정보를 입력 바람≫ </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;↓</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 복학 확정 여부 확인 : 접수 후 다음날 오후1시 이후(휴일제외)&nbsp; </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;≪조회 : 원스톱서비스 → 학적→ 학적 및 각종자료조회 → 학적변동≫</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ 복학 허가는 수업일수 1/4선(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 3. 28</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">)까지만 허용이 가능함 &nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">단, 등록기간(2011. 2. 22 ~ 2. 25)내에 등록금을 납부한 학생만 해당됨&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 02.</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅대학원)장</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
